    // same channel, SAMPLER 0x30-0x37; tempo range = SHIFT + KEYLOCK 0x60 (Serato's); the SX3's SYNC is 0x5D and it has the
    // CFX knobs (ch 7 CC 0x17 / 0x18; not in the SB3's list)
