    // ch 11 CC 0x00; pads deck 1 ch 1 / deck 2 ch 2: HOT CUE 0x00-0x07 (SHIFT +0x40), SAMPLER 0x10-0x17. Jog ticks per
    // revolution not in the map; which end of the pitch fader is the maximum not either (set like the Beatmix). The FX
