    // = 444 ticks/s), TOUCH 0x3F, PLAY 0x24, CUE 0x23, SYNC 0x21, PFL
    // 0x52, line fader CC 0x14, PITCH = pitch bend (Mixxx: the maximum is the + side); crossfader ch 6 CC 0x2F;
    // pads on the deck channel: blue mode 0x00-0x07 (SHIFT +8) = hot cues, red mode 0x10-0x17 = sample select
