  );

  // platter (right column, a pre-made image; round, so it never turns - the sticker line does).
  // Grab the record and turn it = scratch: the angle the hand turns moves the head (1 turn = 1.8 s, clockwise =
  // forward, Shift = 1/4), through the same ui_goal / ui_touch as the waveform drag. Angles are measured in window
  // pixels, so the feel is the same at any window scale; near the spindle the angle is too jumpy and is skipped.
  (
  // the record and the pitch / tape bar under it are one group: the record's top on the content box's top edge,
  // the bar's bottom on its bottom edge; the bar, words included, is exactly as wide as the record (user's choice
  // after mock-ups, 2026-10-03)
  g_pl_r = 100; g_pl_x = g_fc(g_r + g_m + 4 + g_pl_r); g_pl_y = g_t + g_pl_r;
  // bar centre line. From the top: tick marks (rows -13 .. -10), the indicator's point (-9 .. -5, its tip right under a
  // tick), its body over the slot and the slot's lower edge line (-4 .. +5), its shadow (+6, +7): 21 px in all, the
